==English==

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|pl2=conjunctivae}}

# {{context|anatomy|lang=en}} A clear [[mucous membrane]] that lines the inner surface of the [[eyelid]] and the exposed surface of the [[eyeball]] or [[sclera]].

